    "raw": "^orange;Genomes^reset;\n\nA string composed of numbers and characters similar to hexidecimal, but going up to Z instead of F (0-35 instead of 0-15 | 0-1295 instead of 0-255 with two characters)\n\nA genome is composed of (number of stats * 2) characters, where every two characters store the value of a stat. Each such pair is called a gene. The way a stat is translated from stat to string varies, but here's the general idea:\n\nValue * 100 -> char (0 = 00, 12.95 = ZZ, 2 = 5J)\n\nHere is an example set of stats and their genome:\n\nBase Production: 3, Drone Toughness: 1, Drone Breed Rate: 1, Queen Breed Rate: 5, Queen Lifespan: 3, Mutation Chance: 1 (out of 100)\n\nFinal Genome: 030101050301HZ\n\n\n\n^orange;Stats^reset;\n\n-Subtype: A bee's strain within its given breed. These typically have different production output or behaviors.\n-Base Production: Resource production at 100% hive efficiency, excluding other modifiers.\n-Drone Toughness: How well do the drones resist anything that tries to kills them: different queen, lack of queen, rivalry fights, etc.\n-Drone Breed Rate: Base drone breeding rate.\n-Queen Breed Rate: Base queen breeding rate.\n-Queen Lifespan: How many bee production ticks before the queen dies (up to 1295).\n-Mutation Chance: Chance for a drastic mutation to occur. Jumps by (math.floor(100/1295*100*n)*0.01) each increment. (As example: '00': 0 | '01': 0.07 | 'HZ': 49.96 | 'ZZ': 100)\n-Work Time: Some bees are diurnal, some are nocturnal, some are both.\n",
    "value": "^orange;基因组^reset;\n\n由数字和单字组成的字符串，类似于十六进制的工作方式，但最高值Z而不是F（36进制而不是16进制 | 0-1295而不是0-255的双字节）。\n\n一个基因组由多个（二个数字组成的统计量）字符组成，其中每两个字符存储一个统计量的值。每一对这样的字符被称为一个基因。一个统计量从统计量转化为字符串的方式各不相同，但总体思路如下：\n\n值*100 -> 字符串（0 = 00，12.95 = ZZ，2 = 5J）\n\n一个完整的基因组加上目前的统计数值会是这样：\n\n基础产量：3，工蜂韧性：1，工蜂繁殖率：1，蜂后繁殖率：5，蜂后寿命：3，突变几率：1 （最高100）\n\n最后可得基因组：030101050301HZ\n\n\n\n^orange;状态^reset;\n\n-子类：蜜蜂在其所属品种内的子类。不同种类常具有不同的产量或行为。\n-基础产量：资源产量达到100%的蜂巢效率，不包括其他修正。\n-工蜂韧性：工蜂抵抗任何试图杀死它们东西的能力：不同的蜂后、缺乏蜂后、争斗等等。\n-工蜂繁衍率：工蜂的基础繁衍效率。\n-蜂后繁衍率：蜂后的基础繁衍效率。\n-蜂后寿命：在蜂后死亡之前能产下的蜜蜂数量（至多1295）。\n-突变几率：发生急剧突变的几率，每突变一次在(math.floor (100/1295 * 100 * n) * 0.01)之间跳跃。(例如: '00': 0 | '01': 0.07 | 'HZ': 49.96 | 'ZZ': 100)\n-工作时间：有些蜜蜂白天活动，有些夜间活动，有些昼夜不分。\n"
